'''Chips''' was an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was obtained by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Chips was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.
== Appearance ==
The blade of the knife has a chips texture, a black hilt and a black handle.

== Trivia ==

* When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had the chips on its blade removed from the blade and was renamed [[Bronze]].
*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all the players' [[Inventory|inventories]].
